	
	######################################################################################################################
	# Source Name						: collateral.scr
	# Menu							: HPAYOFF
	# Date							: 09-05-2013
	# Description						: This script is set in HPTTM for LINSR Event Type  which is set in HLAGSPM menu.
	# Input Values						: None
	# Output Values						: .
	# Called Scripts					:
	# Calling Script					:
	# Author     						: jane
	# Bank							: Equity Bank
	# Modification History				:
	#	< Version No.> 		<Date>		<Author Name> 		<Description>
